# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Tarren Mill

step To the Undercity
  only Skyborne
  zone Undercity
  tip Head east to the Crossroads and fly to Orgrimmar. Take the zeppelin from the towers outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades; the Undercity lies below the Ruins of Lordaeron. The bat handler is in the Trade Quarter.
  kill 10181 quest 93739.4 "Talk to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner" only Skyborne optional -- Speak with Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, in the Royal Quarter: Exploring the Horde

step Aelthalyste
  only Undead,Priest
  tip Aelthalyste stands in the War Quarter.
  turnin 5646 only Undead -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity

step Master Apothecary Faranell
  zone Undercity
  turnin 513                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Apothecarium
  accept 515 optional                 -- Keep it: the Hillsbrad coast, later on the route
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest

step Archibald
  only Warrior
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Warrior
  zone Undercity
  when level>=20
  when money>=1g
  when !skill "Polearms" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Paladin
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Hunter
  zone Undercity
  when level>=20
  when money>=1g
  when !skill "Polearms" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Rogue
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

